# ROOFCAT: falling into a pit costs a life. Harissa's spirit floats down from
# the top of the screen, flies and shoots twin shots, and pressing A brings
# her back to life wherever the spirit is.
game roofcat
wait 5
cheat area 0 1
cheat clear_foes
cheat cam 320
cheat put 90 83
wait 2
hold RIGHT 30
wait 30
expect lives == 2
expect spirit == 1
expect py < 60
hold RIGHT 30
press B
wait 3
expect stars == 0
wait 20
press A 2
wait 2
expect spirit == 0
expect lives == 2
